repository-code: "https://github.com/AcTweeteR/AGF-Orchestrator"
url: "https://github.com/AcTweeteR/AGF-Orchestrator"
abstract: >-
  AGF-Orchestrator is a provider-neutral governance and orchestration runtime
  for autonomous software-development agents. It separates authority from
  execution and coordinates work under explicit policy, evidence, review,
  Compliance, recovery, provenance, and human-control boundaries.
keywords:
  - autonomous agents
  - coding agents
  - agent governance
  - orchestration
  - AI safety
  - software engineering
